# EXP-27: Categorical Data Prediction using Decision Tree & Logistic Regression in WEKA

======================================================================
  EXPERIMENT 27: CATEGORICAL DATA PREDICTION USING WEKA
======================================================================

1. OBJECTIVE:
   To discretize continuous data and construct Decision Tree (J48) and Logistic 
   Regression models in WEKA for categorical species classification.

2. WEKA ARFF DATASET (iris_categorical_exp27.arff):
----------------------------------------------------------------------
@relation iris_categorical_prediction

@attribute SepalLengthCat {Short, Medium, Long}
@attribute SepalWidthCat {Narrow, Medium, Wide}
@attribute PetalLengthCat {Small, Medium, Large}
@attribute PetalWidthCat {Narrow, Medium, Wide}
@attribute Species {setosa, versicolor, virginica}

@data
Short, Medium, Small, Narrow, setosa
Short, Narrow, Small, Narrow, setosa
Medium, Medium, Medium, Medium, versicolor
Long, Wide, Large, Wide, virginica
Short, Medium, Small, Narrow, setosa
Medium, Narrow, Medium, Medium, versicolor
Long, Medium, Large, Wide, virginica
----------------------------------------------------------------------

3. WEKA EXECUTION STEPS:
   a. Preprocess -> Apply Filter: weka.filters.unsupervised.attribute.Discretize
   b. Classify -> Test J48 & Logistic Regression models.

